      "title": "experience.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}.slide-container{width:1280px;min-height:720px;background:#FAF8F5;color:#2C3E35;font-family:'Noto Sans SC',sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:46px 48px 0}.head{border-top:2px solid #1A3629;padding-top:21px}.motif{color:#C1A673;margin-right:12px}.head h1{font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:34px;color:#1A3629}.head p{font-size:18px;color:#5C6E64;margin-top:13px}.devices{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:70px;flex:1;padding-top:42px}.device{border-top:2px solid #1A3629;padding-top:19px}.device h2{font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;color:#1A3629;font-size:27px}.score{font-size:48px;font-weight:700;color:#276749;margin-top:19px}.device ul{padding-left:23px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.75;margin-top:10px}.flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:240px 62px 240px 62px 400px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid #D9D6CE;padding-top:25px}.node{border:1px solid #D9D6CE;min-height:78px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45}.node strong{display:block;color:#1A3629;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:3px}.node.gold{border-top:3px solid #C1A673;background:#F0EFEA}.node.green{border-top:3px solid #276749}.arrow{text-align:center;color:#C1A673;font-size:32px}.footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;color:#5C6E64;padding-top:14px}.footer span:last-child{font-weight:600}</style></head><body><div class=\"slide-container\"><div class=\"head\"><h1><span class=\"motif\">■</span>首页与句子库：首屏有界，完整能力按需进入</h1><p>首页使用真实的 /api/sentences/daily；完整句子库仍然保留，但只在用户主动进入学习功能时加载。</p></div><div class=\"devices\"><section class=\"device\"><h2>手机 · 390 × 844</h2><div class=\"score\">13 / 13</div><ul><li>今日一句来自既有真实句子数据</li><li>摘要响应小于 10KB</li><li>阿语与中文方向隔离</li><li>无横向溢出、无 JavaScript 错误</li></ul></section><section class=\"device\"><h2>桌面 · 1280 × 900</h2><div class=\"score\">13 / 13</div><ul><li>保持不等宽双区信息层级</li><li>今日一句可进入真实句子库</li><li>次级工具默认折叠且入口仍保留</li><li>首页首屏不请求全量 /api/sentences</li></ul></section></div><div class=\"flow\"><div class=\"node\"><strong>首页打开</strong>仅请求 daily 摘要</div><div class=\"arrow\">→</div><div class=\"node gold\"><strong>今日一句</strong>小响应、稳定日期选择</div><div class=\"arrow\">→</div><div class=\"node green\"><strong>主动进入句子库 / 闪卡 / 跟读</strong>加载版本化 builtin_sentences.js；实际验证数据 29,740 项</div></div><div class=\"footer\"><span>来源：公网浏览器回归、按需资源回归</span><span>06 / 08</span></div></div></body></html>"
