      "title": "health.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}.slide-container{width:1280px;min-height:720px;background:#FAF8F5;color:#2C3E35;font-family:'Noto Sans SC',sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:46px 48px 0}.head{border-top:2px solid #1A3629;padding-top:21px}.motif{color:#C1A673;margin-right:12px}.head h1{font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:34px;color:#1A3629}.head p{font-size:18px;color:#5C6E64;margin-top:13px}.content{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:720px 1fr;gap:62px;padding-top:46px}.big{font-size:52px;font-weight:700;color:#276749;line-height:1}.caption{font-size:17px;color:#5C6E64;margin-top:7px}.table{margin-top:32px;border-top:2px solid #1A3629;border-bottom:2px solid #1A3629}.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 150px 90px;min-height:48px;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid #D9D6CE;font-size:17px}.row:first-child{border-top:0;font-weight:700;color:#1A3629}.ok{color:#276749;font-weight:700;text-align:right}.count{text-align:right}.side{padding-top:24px}.side h2{font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:27px;color:#1A3629}.code{margin-top:22px;background:#F0EFEA;border-left:3px solid #C1A673;padding:23px 25px;font-family:monospace;font-size:16px;line-height:1.68;color:#1A3629}.system{margin-top:32px;border-top:1px solid #D9D6CE;padding-top:22px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7}.footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;color:#5C6E64;padding-top:14px}.footer span:last-child{font-weight:600}</style></head><body><div class=\"slide-container\"><div class=\"head\"><h1><span class=\"motif\">■</span>健康监控：243次连续探测全部通过</h1><p>最近约四小时，每分钟检查公网、本地、目录完整性与六大部圣训入口。</p></div><div class=\"content\"><section><div class=\"big\">243 / 243</div><div class=\"caption\">最近窗口内可解析的健康 JSONL 记录全部 <strong>ok=true</strong></div><div class=\"table\"><div class=\"row\"><span>健康条件</span><span class=\"count\">通过次数</span><span class=\"ok\">状态</span></div><div class=\"row\"><span>nur.service active</span><span class=\"count\">243 / 243</span><span class=\"ok\">通过</span></div><div class=\"row\"><span>公网 HTTP 接口全 200</span><span class=\"count\">243 / 243</span><span class=\"ok\">通过</span></div><div class=\"row\"><span>本地 HTTP 接口全 200</span><span class=\"count\">243 / 243</span><span class=\"ok\">通过</span></div><div class=\"row\"><span>目录总数保持 8,794</span><span class=\"count\">243 / 243</span><span class=\"ok\">通过</span></div><div class=\"row\"><span>六大部圣训入口总数 6</span><span class=\"count\">243 / 243</span><span class=\"ok\">通过</span></div></div></section><aside class=\"side\"><h2>当前健康快照</h2><div class=\"code\">ok: true<br>service_active: true<br>public_http_all_200: true<br>local_http_200: true<br>catalog_total_8794: true<br>sunnah_total_6: true</div><div class=\"system\">磁盘可用：<strong>35.38 GB</strong><br>内存可用：<strong>1,938 MB</strong><br>内存使用：<strong>47.0%</strong><br>服务重启：<strong>0</strong></div></aside></div><div class=\"footer\"><span>来源：/var/log/nur-monitor/health.jsonl、systemd 状态</span><span>02 / 08</span></div></div></body></html>"
