      "path": "latency.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "latency.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@3.9.1\"></script><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}.slide-container{width:1280px;min-height:720px;background:#FAF8F5;color:#2C3E35;font-family:'Noto Sans SC',sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:46px 48px 0}.head{border-top:2px solid #1A3629;padding-top:21px}.motif{color:#C1A673;margin-right:12px}.head h1{font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:34px;color:#1A3629}.head p{font-size:17px;color:#5C6E64;margin-top:13px}.content{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:850px 1fr;gap:50px;padding-top:25px}.chartbox{height:410px}.side{border-left:1px solid #D9D6CE;padding:28px 0 0 35px}.metric{font-size:45px;color:#C1A673;font-weight:700;line-height:1}.metriclabel{font-size:15px;color:#5C6E64;margin:8px 0 29px}.side h2{font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:24px;color:#1A3629;margin-bottom:14px}.side p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;margin-bottom:18px}.side strong{color:#1A3629}.footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;color:#5C6E64;padding-top:14px}.footer span:last-child{font-weight:600}</style></head><body><div class=\"slide-container\"><div class=\"head\"><h1><span class=\"motif\">■</span>/api/nodes：成功率100%，尾延迟在瞬时突发时明显抬升</h1><p>单位：毫秒。所有测试请求均为 HTTP 200，并从缓存返回节点数据；图中展示真实 P50、P95 与最大值。</p></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"chartbox\"><canvas id=\"latencyChart\"></canvas></div><aside class=\"side\"><div class=\"metric\">6.92 秒</div><div class=\"metriclabel\">60并发过期缓存的最大延迟</div><h2>如何解读</h2><p><strong>正确性稳定：</strong>600 / 600 请求成功，刷新隔离未失效。</p><p><strong>尾部受压：</strong>60个瞬时连接会放大公网代理、TLS/连接队列与单进程线程调度的等待。</p><p><strong>稳定热缓存：</strong>20并发第3波 P95 为 355ms，最大 376ms。</p></aside></div><div class=\"footer\"><span>来源：2026-10-10 公网 /api/nodes 两组并发测试</span><span>04 / 08</span></div></div><script>new Chart(document.getElementById('latencyChart'),{type:'bar',data:{labels:['60并发\\n过期','60并发\\n热缓存','20并发\\n第1波','20并发\\n第2波','20并发\\n第3波'],datasets:[{label:'P50',data:[139.59,231.8,128.66,126.98,133.56],backgroundColor:'#1A3629'},{label:'P95',data:[6563.54,1504.2,2906.8,213.91,355.21],backgroundColor:'#C1A673'},{label:'最大值',data:[6924.68,2952.02,3924.01,1144.44,376.44],backgroundColor:'#4A6B58'}]},options:{animation:false,maintainAspectRatio:false,plugins:{legend:{position:'bottom',labels:{font:{family:'Noto Sans SC',size:14},color:'#2C3E35'}},tooltip:{enabled:false}},scales:{x:{grid:{display:false},ticks:{font:{family:'Noto Sans SC',size:12},color:'#5C6E64'}},y:{beginAtZero:true,grid:{color:'#D9D6CE'},ticks:{font:{family:'Noto Sans SC',size:12},color:'#5C6E64'},title:{display:true,text:'延迟（ms）',color:'#5C6E64',font:{family:'Noto Sans SC',size:13}}}}}});</script></body></html>"
