      "path": "optimization.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "optimization.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}.slide-container{width:1280px;min-height:720px;background:#FAF8F5;color:#2C3E35;font-family:'Noto Sans SC',sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:46px 48px 0}.head{border-top:2px solid #1A3629;padding-top:21px}.motif{color:#C1A673;margin-right:12px}.head h1{font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:34px;color:#1A3629}.head p{font-size:18px;color:#5C6E64;margin-top:13px}.flow{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 50px 1fr 50px 1fr 50px 1fr;align-items:center;padding-top:42px}.stage{min-height:300px;border-top:3px solid #1A3629;border-bottom:1px solid #D9D6CE;padding:25px 21px}.stage.gold{border-top-color:#C1A673}.stage h2{font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:25px;color:#1A3629}.num{color:#C1A673;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:12px}.stage ul{padding-left:21px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;margin-top:22px}.arrow{text-align:center;color:#C1A673;font-size:35px}.accept{border-top:1px solid #D9D6CE;padding-top:20px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;color:#2C3E35}.accept strong{color:#1A3629}.footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;color:#5C6E64;padding-top:14px}.footer span:last-child{font-weight:600}</style></head><body><div class=\"slide-container\"><div class=\"head\"><h1><span class=\"motif\">■</span>节点接口性能优化方案：让缓存读取更短、更可预测</h1><p>不改变节点内容、不扩大外部抓取；只治理响应快路径、连接排队、刷新来源与可观测性。</p></div><div class=\"flow\"><section class=\"stage\"><div class=\"num\">01 · 快路径</div><h2>预解析快照</h2><ul><li>内存同时持有 YAML 与 nodes JSON</li><li>刷新完成后一次原子交换</li><li>避免每请求正则扫描 YAML</li></ul></section><div class=\"arrow\">→</div><section class=\"stage\"><div class=\"num\">02 · 连接治理</div><h2>突发隔离</h2><ul><li>确认 NGINX/Cloudflare 连接复用</li><li>端点微缓存 1–5 秒</li><li>记录并发队列与排队时间</li></ul></section><div class=\"arrow\">→</div><section class=\"stage gold\"><div class=\"num\">03 · 刷新治理</div><h2>来源可控</h2><ul><li>持久化最后成功快照</li><li>外源健康评分与退避</li><li>刷新耗时、失败率、节点数指标</li></ul></section><div class=\"arrow\">→</div><section class=\"stage\"><div class=\"num\">04 · 验收</div><h2>公开回归</h2><ul><li>冷/热/过期三态压测</li><li>P50、P95、P99、错误率</li><li>备份、原子发布与可回滚</li></ul></section></div><div class=\"accept\"><strong>建议验收门槛：</strong>60 并发下保持 100% 成功与单飞刷新；热缓存 P95 以公网实测为准，并持续记录长尾根因。每一项优化独立发布、独立回归。</div><div class=\"footer\"><span>优先级：先优化读缓存路径，再处理连接突发与订阅来源质量</span><span>05 / 08</span></div></div></body></html>"
    },
    {
      "path": "roadmap.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "roadmap.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}.slide-container{width:1280px;min-height:720px;background:#FAF8F5;color:#2C3E35;font-family:'Noto Sans SC',sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:46px 48px 0}.head{border-top:2px solid #1A3629;padding-top:21px}.motif{color:#C1A673;margin-right:12px}.head h1{font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:34px;color:#1A3629}.head p{font-size:18px;color:#5C6E64;margin-top:13px}.timeline{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:28px;align-items:center;padding-top:33px}.phase{min-height:265px;border-top:3px solid #1A3629;border-bottom:1px solid #D9D6CE;padding-top:20px}.phase.gold{border-top-color:#C1A673}.phase .n{color:#C1A673;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:2px}.phase h2{font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:24px;color:#1A3629;margin-top:11px}.phase ul{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;padding-left:20px;margin-top:18px}.measure{border-top:1px solid #D9D6CE;padding-top:18px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.55;color:#1A3629}.footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;color:#5C6E64;padding-top:14px}.footer span:last-child{font-weight:600}</style></head><body><div class=\"slide-container\"><div class=\"head\"><h1><span class=\"motif\">■</span>路线图：先稳住入口，再提升阅读与研究密度</h1><p>每一步都以线上回归收口：健康监控、冷/热/过期缓存、首页网络、移动安全区、RTL/LTR 与阅读器交互。</p></div><div class=\"timeline\"><section class=\"phase\"><div class=\"n\">PHASE 01</div><h2>节点快路径</h2><ul><li>预解析 JSON 快照</li><li>YAML/JSON 原子交换</li><li>缓存命中与序列化耗时指标</li></ul></section><section class=\"phase\"><div class=\"n\">PHASE 02</div><h2>连接突发治理</h2><ul><li>连接复用与端点微缓存</li><li>并发闸门与队列可观测</li><li>针对 P95/P99 做公网复测</li></ul></section><section class=\"phase gold\"><div class=\"n\">PHASE 03</div><h2>外源质量治理</h2><ul><li>记录来源健康评分</li><li>404/超时退避和失效源替换</li><li>最后成功快照持久化</li></ul></section><section class=\"phase\"><div class=\"n\">PHASE 04</div><h2>体验持续回归</h2><ul><li>全站功能工作区入口</li><li>阅读器纸面与词卡细节</li><li>主题、双向文本、手机布局</li></ul></section></div><div class=\"measure\"><strong>不变原则：</strong>不覆盖 AI 密钥、用户、支付、会员、缓存或监控数据；不删除书库、词汇、经文、AI、语音及学习能力；发布永远先备份、后最小替换、再公网验证。</div><div class=\"footer\"><span>NOUR：让用户稳定地阅读整个阿拉伯语世界</span><span>08 / 08</span></div></div></body></html>"
    },
    {
      "path": "singleflight.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "singleflight.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}.slide-container{width:1280px;min-height:720px;background:#FAF8F5;color:#2C3E35;font-family:'Noto Sans SC',sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:46px 48px 0}.head{border-top:2px solid #1A3629;padding-top:21px}.motif{color:#C1A673;margin-right:12px}.head h1{font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:34px;color:#1A3629}.head p{font-size:18px;color:#5C6E64;margin-top:13px}.lanes{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:170px 1fr;padding-top:58px}.labels{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-around;padding-bottom:50px;font-size:21px;font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;color:#1A3629}.flow{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-around;padding-bottom:50px}.line{height:1px;background:#D9D6CE;width:100%}.steps{position:absolute;inset:0 35px 50px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:35px}.step{min-height:102px;border:1px solid #D9D6CE;background:#FAF8F5;padding:17px 20px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45}.step strong{display:block;color:#1A3629;font-size:20px;margin-bottom:7px}.step.cache{border-top:3px solid #1A3629}.step.worker{border-top:3px solid #C1A673;background:#F0EFEA}.step.result{border-top:3px solid #276749}.arrow{font-size:32px;color:#C1A673;text-align:center}.notes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:36px;border-top:1px solid #D9D6CE;padding-top:18px;font-size:16px;color:#5C6E64;line-height:1.55}.notes strong{color:#1A3629}.footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;color:#5C6E64;padding-top:14px}.footer span:last-child{font-weight:600}</style></head><body><div class=\"slide-container\"><div class=\"head\"><h1><span class=\"motif\">■</span>单飞刷新：300个请求只触发一次后台刷新</h1><p>过期缓存采用 stale-while-revalidate：所有请求先读快照，刷新只在后台运行。</p></div><div class=\"lanes\"><div class=\"labels\"><span>用户请求</span><span>缓存状态机</span><span>刷新 Worker</span></div><div class=\"flow\"><div class=\"line\"></div><div class=\"line\"></div><div class=\"line\"></div><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step cache\"><strong>300 并发请求</strong>300 / 300 返回 HTTP 200。状态为 refreshing=true、stale=true。</div><div class=\"arrow\">→</div><div class=\"step worker\"><strong>唯一后台 worker</strong>第一条过期请求获得刷新令牌；其他请求不重复抓取或测速。</div><div></div><div class=\"step cache\"><strong>最近成功快照</strong>YAML/JSON 立即回给用户，不等待第三方来源。</div><div class=\"arrow\">→</div><div></div><div></div><div class=\"step result\"><strong>刷新成功</strong>测速完成后写入 559 bytes 新快照，节点数 3，refreshing=false。</div></div></div></div><div class=\"notes\"><div><strong>日志事实：</strong>本次刷新中 4 个外部源返回 404，但工作线程没有失败，仍成功获得可用来源与缓存结果。</div><div><strong>保护机制：</strong>若刷新失败，旧缓存继续保留；冷缓存也返回可识别的临时 YAML，不会同步阻塞调用者。</div></div><div class=\"footer\"><span>来源：nur.service journal，2026-10-10 16:53 UTC</span><span>03 / 08</span></div></div></body></html>"
    },
